Batch-8 eight-group gains are $2.06$--$2.76\times$; arXiv scan is 849$\to$216\,$\mu$s plus 16.7\,$\mu$s merge. At batch 1,000 and $\alpha=200$, independent grouping instead raises scan 3,530$\to$7,652\,$\mu$s plus 2,624\,$\mu$s merging, reaching only $0.46\times$ one-block QPS. Shared bounds reduce work, without removing this regime change.

